  "category": "Dry",
  "description": "Have your veggies and enjoy them, too, with Progresso Vegetable Classics Vegetable Soup. This canned vegetable soup adds a twist for extra substance: rotini pasta. Enjoy delicious ingredients like carrots, celery, green beans, tomato, and more. Made with one-half cup of vegetables per serving, this soup contains no artificial flavors, no colors from artificial sources and no added MSG. Unlike instant ramen, Progresso soup is ready to serve, no need to add water. Serve a bowl or cup of Progresso Vegetable Soup alongside a warm grilled cheese sandwich or freshly baked bread. To prepare instant soup on the stovetop, simply heat in a saucepan. For microwavable soup, heat in a microwave-safe bowl for 2-4 minutes on high. Let soup sit for 1 minute before removing from the microwave. Handle with care, stir, eat and enjoy! At Progresso, we're passionate about making great products. We've been creating soups ranging from Chicken Noodle to Beef &amp; Vegetable and beyond for more than 100 years. And today, Progresso still uses quality ingredients for a tasteful flavor found only in our line of canned soup products.",
